Package: ggpatchy
Title: Pattern Fill Overlays for 'ggplot2' Geoms
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given   = "Timothy",
      family  = "Barrett",
      email   = "dr.timothy.j.barrett@gmail.com",
      role    = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7703-1011")
    )
Description: Adds a 'pattern' aesthetic to 'ggplot2' geoms including bar,
    column, polygon, ribbon, and area charts. Discrete variables are mapped
    to hatch, crosshatch, dot, and other fill patterns rendered via native
    'grid' graphics — no external raster dependencies are required. Patterns
    are clipped to the exact shape of each geom and scale cleanly at any
    output resolution.
